  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credit Expansion Program for Investments in Telecommunications Networks</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Ampliacin del Crdito para Inversiones en Redes de Telecomunicaciones</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es contribuir a la transformacin digital de Brasil a travs de la mejora de la cobertura de conectividad digital en municipios de menos de 30.000 habitantes. El objetivo especfico del proyecto es ampliar la oferta de financiamiento de largo plazo a pequeos ISP para inversiones en expansin de infraestructura de internet fija para mejorar la cobertura de conectividad digital en municipios de menos de 30.000 habitantes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of the program is to improve digital connectivity in Brazil by expanding fixed broadband population coverage in municipalities with less than 30,000 inhabitants. The specific development objective of the program is to expand the supply of long-term financing to small Internet Service Providers (ISPs) investing in fixed broadband infrastructure in municipalities with less than 30,000 inhabitants.</narrative>
  </description>
